{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/bfc28f17126a49ff216101205f63ff88.avif?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=540 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with endless waves of monsters, protect your Mech Spider, and mine resources in Ocean Keeper, a survival co-op roguelike with tower defense elements. Step into the role of one of <i><strong>four survival miners</strong></i>, and do whatever it takes <strong>to stay alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the time between each wave to upgrade your weapons, enhance a Mech, strengthen your team, or explore new underwater dungeons. Enjoy the beauty of the ocean depths and its mysterious creatures \u2013 but stay careful. In Ocean Keeper, the danger waits for you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/d269ed363bba81302b76bc0e7afeb112.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/03378e72b94aa304adbe4b568109e806.poster.avif?t=1760018149\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/03378e72b94aa304adbe4b568109e806.webm?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/03378e72b94aa304adbe4b568109e806.mp4?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends and climb into the Mech Spider to kill thousands of monsters. Work as a team to protect your Mech \u2013 if it goes down, your crew will be defenseless against hordes of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/2c1a6b4be7c021a8b7db67e1080074d9.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9e0a944388799edbf4c2d5fdf1e337a8.poster.avif?t=1760018149\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9e0a944388799edbf4c2d5fdf1e337a8.webm?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9e0a944388799edbf4c2d5fdf1e337a8.mp4?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a rest from endless battles and explore the caves in search of valuable resources and rare artifacts. But don\u2019t get too comfortable \u2013 your team has just one minute to mine, upgrade your gear, and get ready for the next wave. If you are brave enough,\u00a0 you might find something truly powerful\u2026 just in time to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/01d0cdd4bd49c079c3cdbdaedb9094b3.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.poster.avif?t=1760018149\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.webm?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.mp4?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources from the ocean depths to unlock and upgrade powerful gear. Choose from 9 unique weapons \u2013 each with its own range, strengths, and playstyle. Don\u2019t forget to coordinate with your team and plan your loadout beforehand: strategic positioning is key to protecting your Mech and surviving the endless waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/e3873414928f13f10f2e35b4727c6887.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9945f5de5ee6becf503adfb8103e4765.poster.avif?t=1760018149\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9945f5de5ee6becf503adfb8103e4765.webm?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean Keeper, no two waves are ever the same. Each brings new challenges, enemies, and opportunities for your team to adapt, strategize, and survive various underwater adventures. Upgrade your gear differently every time, uncover rare relics, and battle frightening bosses \u2013 you will never experience any run twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So gear up, dive deep, and may your Mech legs never rust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, survival miners \u2013 the ocean is waiting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937360?t=1760018149","ba