class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a rest from endless battles and explore the caves in search of valuable resources and rare artifacts. But don\u2019t get too comfortable \u2013 your team has just one minute to mine, upgrade your gear, and get ready for the next wave. If you are brave enough,\u00a0 you might find something truly powerful\u2026 just in time to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/01d0cdd4bd49c079c3cdbdaedb9094b3.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.poster.avif?t=1760018149\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.webm?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/8da11b3270e5f2833f642005a267a4db.mp4?t=1760018149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources from the ocean depths to unlock and upgrade powerful gear. Choose from 9 unique weapons \u2013 each with its own range, strengths, and playstyle. Don\u2019t forget to coordinate with your team and plan your loadout beforehand: strategic positioning is key to protecting your Mech and surviving the endless waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/e3873414928f13f10f2e35b4727c6887.webp?t=1760018149\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline cross